article
  +h(1, "AutolumeGallery")
  p.description
    | An interactive virtual gallery space where users can manipulate and explore the latent space of a GAN in 3D.

  section#abstract
    +h(2, "Abstract")

    p.introduction
      | AutolumeGallery is an interactive virtual gallery space where users can manipulate and explore the latent space of a GAN in 3D. A canvas receives artwork generated in real-time from Autolume-Live, influenced by the position and rotation of several objects in the virtual environment. Users can use these "manipulators" to alter the piece and take an active role in its creation and appearance. The GAN model was trained on the abstract artwork of my late grandfather, Peter John Voormeij, as my way of honouring and connecting with his work.

    +h(3, "Links")
    ul.list
      li Code: #[a.link(href="https://github.com/rdezwart/AutolumeGallery" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer") GitHub]
      li Paper: #[a.link(href="/file/AutolumeGallery_RobinDeZwart.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer") View PDF]
      li Dataset: #[a.link(href="https://voormeij.ca/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer") Peter John Voormeij]

    div.youtube-container
      iframe(src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/Brn7nG2WOXA?si=ApqnHnHsTaW3ukRk&rel=0&hl=en-ca" title="AutolumeGallery - Demo Video" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen)

  section
    +h(2, "Examples")

    img.img(src="img/gallery_example-1.png" alt="The Autolume canvas in VR, a mix of greens, yellows, and whites." loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080")
    img.img(src="img/gallery_example-2.png" alt="The base texture of the canvas, primarily oranges and whites." loading="lazy" width="1024" height="1024")
    img.img(src="img/gallery_example-3.png" alt="The base texture of the canvas, primarily blues and greens." loading="lazy" width="1024" height="1024")

  section
    +h(2, "Under Construction")

    p
      | The rest of this page is still under construction, for now. If you're looking for more information about this project, please see the #[a.link(href="/file/AutolumeGallery_RobinDeZwart.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer") paper] I wrote for it.

    p Thank you for stopping by!
